{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["נפתולי אלהים נפתלתי — 'I have joined אלהים's joining': the construct state, נפתלתי, 'I have joined myself.' The first nun is on account of the second nun. And likewise נכסוף נכספתה; נשאל נשאל דוד."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {0 "The lemma נפתולי is vocalized with a qames under the nun, apparently reflecting a noun-form; Rashbam reads it as construct state before אלהים. The phrase 'נתחברתי' appears to gloss the verb נפתלתי as a reflexive/reciprocal 'I joined myself.'"}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:45:42.414712642Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}